// Ono-Sendai for claude-desktop-extra (Claude Desktop with custom themes).
// Same house style as the Omarchy theme: deck black, warm off-white type, and
// Ono-Sendai red for the brand mark, links, buttons and focus; orange for the
// secondary accent so the two stay apart. Light mode is the same red on a pale
// warm panel.
// The "backdrop" line is the animated scene (the matrix: grid floor, wireframe
// data structures, pulses of light). claude-desktop-scene.py writes it; don't
// edit it by hand.
// Install: ln -s "$PWD/claude-desktop.jsonc" ~/.config/Claude/themes.d/ono-sendai.jsonc
{
  "themes": {
    "ono-sendai": {
      "name": "Ono-Sendai",
